config ESPHOME_SENDSPIN_MEMORY_OPTIMIZATIONS
    bool "Size PCM receive overhead from its format and release idle artwork assemblies"
    default n
    help
        Preserve Sendspin audio quotas, message limits and artwork caps while
        deriving the receive hold window from PCM formats when no compressed
        codec is offered. Allocate encoded artwork assemblies only during a
        transfer or a parked acknowledgement, and release after the synchronous
        decode callback or discard. The original 0.9.3 behavior remains when off.
